cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NTC Atlas or its data, please cite it as below. Please also cite the original papers for any result you take from the atlas."
title: "NTC Atlas: an interactive, evidence-backed atlas of network traffic classification research"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Changrampadi
    given-names: Mohamed Hashim
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1852-0998"
    affiliation: "Chalmers University of Technology"
repository-code: "https://github.com/cmhashim/ntc-atlas"
url: "https://ntc-atlas.pages.dev"
abstract: "An interactive atlas of network traffic classification research, from port rules and flow statistics to pretrained and foundation models, with a focus on encrypted traffic. Every analytical statement links to its source; paper claims, later criticism and curator interpretation are kept separate."
keywords:
  - network traffic classification
  - encrypted traffic
  - literature review
  - foundation models
  - intrusion detection
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
